  Default (Japanese). English lives in values-en/.

  Counted quantities are <plurals>, not a "(s)" suffix on a <string>. Japanese
  has one form and so carries only `other`; the point is that a language with
  more of them has somewhere to put them, without the call sites changing.
-->
