    <string name="sign_pin">署名用パスワード（英数字 6〜16 文字）</string>
    <string name="sign_pin_uppercase">英字は大文字で入力してください</string>

    <!--
         PIN format problems. Resolved here, not in :jpki, which has no locale.

         Two keys, two names, and they are not interchangeable. The one this app
         signs with is the 署名用電子証明書 password: 6-16 alphanumerics. 暗証番号 is
         what people know as the 4-digit 利用者証明用 PIN, so it stays on the
         exact-length and digits-only messages, which only that key can produce,
         and everything on the signing path says 署名用パスワード instead. Calling
         the field one thing and its own error another is how someone ends up
         typing the wrong one, on a key that takes a trip to a municipal window
         to unblock.
    -->
    <string name="pin_error_length_exact">暗証番号は %1$d 桁で入力してください</string>
    <string name="pin_error_length_range">署名用パスワードは %1$d〜%2$d 文字で入力してください</string>
    <string name="pin_error_digits">暗証番号は数字のみです</string>
    <string name="pin_error_uppercase">署名用パスワードは数字と大文字の英字のみです</string>

